    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible-light-promoted photoredox-catalyzed dicarbofunctionalization of styrenes using CO2 and tertiary amines to synthesize gamma-amino acids. Using 4CzIPN as a photocatalyst and LiCl as an additive, the reaction proceeds via the generation of alpha-aminoalkyl radicals that add to styrenes, followed by carbanion formation and nucleophilic capture of CO2.",
